	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Name = `06. Special Navigation System & Station-Note06SpecialNav`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note06SpecialNav`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Body = `06. Special Navigation System & Station Story

Hyperbolic or long-range navigation chains (LORAN-C, GNSS ground augmentation) are modeled by [models.SpecialNavigationSystemTimeSliceType]
and individual transmitter stations ([models.SpecialNavigationStationTimeSliceType]) with [models.SpecialNavigationStationStatusType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.BodyHTML = `<p>06. Special Navigation System &amp; Station Story
<p>Hyperbolic or long-range navigation chains (LORAN-C, GNSS ground augmentation) are modeled by <a href="/models#SpecialNavigationSystemTimeSliceType">models.SpecialNavigationSystemTimeSliceType</a>
and individual transmitter stations (<a href="/models#SpecialNavigationStationTimeSliceType">models.SpecialNavigationStationTimeSliceType</a>) with <a href="/models#SpecialNavigationStationStatusType">models.SpecialNavigationStationStatusType</a>.
`
